Bundled data
------------
The package contains data about Cambodia's administrative divisions (provinces, districts,
communes and villages), published by the General Directorate of Digital Economy (GDDE),
Ministry of Economy and Finance, Royal Government of Cambodia.

  Source: https://data.mef.gov.kh
  Terms:  https://data.mef.gov.kh/terms-of-use

The data is used under the Data EF Terms of Use, which require attribution to the data source.
The values are reproduced unmodified (only re-encoded into PHP arrays).
The MIT License applies to the source code only; the data remains subject to the terms above.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
